    about:'The UK Standard Visitor Visa allows Indians to visit for tourism, business, or family for up to 6 months. Our experts craft a strong application with a compelling cover letter that greatly increases approval odds.',
    requirements:['Valid Indian passport (min. 6 months validity)','Online application (UKVi portal)','Biometrics appointment at VFS','Bank statements (last 6 months)','Employment letter & leave approval','Property or asset evidence','Travel itinerary & hotel bookings','Sponsor letter (if applicable)'],
