    emoji:'📋', tag:'Documents', img:'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568605114967-8130f3a36994?w=1200&q=90&fit=crop&auto=format',
    title:'Visa Photo Requirements: Country-Wise Guide 2026',
    excerpt:'Wrong photo size is the #1 reason for processing delays. Use this guide to get it right the first time.',
